questions.question:
Which of the following expressions is correct? 

1. Mode - median = 2 (median - mean)

2. Median = {Mode + median over 2}

3. Mode = 2 Median - mean

4. Mean = {2Median - mode over 2}

questions.solution:
**Given:**

11 - {7 - 56 ÷ (2 × 3 + 1)}

**Concept used:**

BODMAS rule.

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] 

**Calculation:**

According to the BODMAS rule, we will solve the expression.

11 - {7 - 56 ÷ (__**2 × 3**__ + 1)}

= 11 - {7 - 56 ÷ (**__6 + 1__**)}

= 11 - {7 - __**56 ÷ 7**__}

= 11 - {__**7 - 8**__}

= 11 - {- 1}

= 11 + 1

= 12

**Hence, the correct answer is 12.**
